OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power as Storm
OL,4,AAusten lashes south-west England and
OL,5,Athe Channel Islands
OL,6,
OL,7,FNearly 7,000 homes in Cornwall and
OL,8,FDevon are currently without power as
OL,9,FStorm Austen sweeps across parts of the
OL,10,FUK
OL,12,FThe Met Office has issued an amber
OL,13,Fweather warning for strong winds for
OL,14,FCornwall and parts of Devon. Meanwhile,
OL,15,Fa red warning in place for Guernsey and
OL,16,FJersey
OL,18,FGusts of up to 80mph are set to hit the
OL,19,FSouth West and the Channel Islands -
OL,20,Fhere's a look at the highest gusts
OL,21,Frecorded so far this morning
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
