OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power as Storm
OL,4,AAusten lashes south-west England and
OL,5,Athe Channel Islands
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll schools in Jersey have been told to
OL,8,Fclose on Friday. A number of schools
OL,9,Fare also closed or opening late in
OL,10,FCornwall
OL,12,FTransport disruption is likely, with
OL,13,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) saying
OL,14,Fspeed limits will be in place on routes
OL,15,Fbetween Devon and Cornwall until 13:00
OL,17,FDevon County Council is urging people
OL,18,Fto postpone non-essential journeys
OL,19,Fwhile in Cornwall locals report
OL,20,Fdisruptions due to fallen trees and
OL,21,Fpower lines
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
